<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Telesom</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/2002">2002</a>–</span> · <a href="/centuries/21st-century">21st century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Telesom is a telecommunications company based in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hargeisa">Hargeisa</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-somaliland">Somaliland</a>, founded in 2002. It is the largest mobile operator in Somaliland, and its ZAAD mobile-money service, launched in 2009, made electronic payments part of everyday life in a territory with little formal banking.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/telesom.jpg" alt="Telesom" width="320" height="203" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Telesom · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Telesom_logo.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
